#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:2
msgid "Native NIXL"
msgstr "原生 NIXL"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:4
msgid ""
"``nixl_native`` is LMCache's optional C++ NIXL L2 adapter. It registers "
"the complete L1 DRAM arena once per worker and submits each LMCache tile "
"as one NIXL descriptor-list transfer."
msgstr "``nixl_native`` 是 LMCache 的可选 C++ NIXL L2 适配器。它为每个工作线程注册一次完整的 L1 DRAM 区域，并将每个 LMCache 块作为一个 NIXL 描述符列表传输。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:8
msgid "The backend is the single storage selector:"
msgstr "后端是唯一的存储选择器："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:17
msgid ""
"``POSIX`` advertising ``FILE_SEG`` and ``OBJ`` advertising ``OBJ_SEG`` "
"are the reference configurations below. Another plugin can be substituted"
" only when it supports ``DRAM_SEG`` and exactly one of those storage "
"segments. The connector checks those capabilities when it starts and "
"rejects ambiguous plugins."
msgstr "``POSIX`` 广告的 ``FILE_SEG`` 和 ``OBJ`` 广告的 ``OBJ_SEG`` 是下面的参考配置。只有在支持 ``DRAM_SEG`` 和其中一个存储段时，才能替换为其他插件。连接器在启动时检查这些能力，并拒绝模糊的插件。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:23
msgid "Build and runtime requirements"
msgstr "构建和运行时要求"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:25
msgid ""
"The minimum supported NIXL version is 1.3.0. A source installation must "
"install the public C++ headers as well as ``libnixl``. Build LMCache "
"with:"
msgstr "支持的最低 NIXL 版本是 1.3.0。源代码安装必须安装公共 C++ 头文件以及 ``libnixl``。使用以下命令构建 LMCache："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:35
msgid ""
"``NIXL_PREFIX=/opt/nixl`` can replace the two directory variables when "
"the installation uses conventional ``include`` and ``lib`` directories. "
"The build produces ``lmcache.lmcache_nixl`` as an isolated C++20 "
"extension. A normal build without NIXL headers and libraries does not "
"build or import this extension."
msgstr "``NIXL_PREFIX=/opt/nixl`` 可以在安装使用常规 ``include`` 和 ``lib`` 目录时替换这两个目录变量。构建会生成 ``lmcache.lmcache_nixl`` 作为一个独立的 C++20 扩展。没有 NIXL 头文件和库的正常构建不会构建或导入此扩展。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:40
msgid ""
"At runtime, the dynamic NIXL plugins must be discoverable. NIXL normally "
"looks in the ``plugins`` directory next to ``libnixl``. Set "
"``NIXL_PLUGIN_DIR`` when the plugins are installed elsewhere, and ensure "
"the dynamic linker can find ``libnixl`` (for example with the system "
"linker cache or ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``)."
msgstr "在运行时，动态 NIXL 插件必须可被发现。NIXL 通常在与 ``libnixl`` 相邻的 ``plugins`` 目录中查找。当插件安装在其他位置时，请设置 ``NIXL_PLUGIN_DIR``，并确保动态链接器能够找到 ``libnixl``（例如通过系统链接器缓存或 ``LD_LIBRARY_PATH``）。"

