#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:75
msgid ""
"The adapter rejects missing L1 memory, invalid backend names, backends "
"that advertise neither or both storage segments, non-string backend "
"parameters, and non-positive worker counts during startup. An inferred "
"object strategy rejects eviction configuration because NIXL 1.3 does not "
"expose object deletion."
msgstr "适配器在启动时拒绝缺失的 L1 内存、无效的后端名称、既不宣传也不同时宣传存储段的后端、非字符串的后端参数以及非正的工作线程数量。推断的对象策略拒绝逐出配置，因为 NIXL 1.3 不支持对象删除。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:81
msgid "POSIX FILE example"
msgstr "POSIX 文件示例"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:83
msgid "Create a writable directory and start the MP server:"
msgstr "创建一个可写目录并启动 MP 服务器："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:103
msgid ""
"POSIX transfers use path-mode registration. For example, a buffered store"
" and load can register these metadata strings (the path after the first "
"colon is an absolute cache path):"
msgstr "POSIX 传输使用路径模式注册。例如，缓冲存储和加载可以注册这些元数据字符串（第一个冒号后的路径是绝对缓存路径）："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:112
msgid ""
"Each file in a batch receives a distinct synthetic device ID. NIXL opens "
"a registered path, owns its file descriptor through the transfer, and "
"closes it during deregistration. For stores, ``sync`` asks NIXL to "
"preserve the durable completion boundary. After deregistration closes the"
" files, LMCache publishes the completed temporary paths with an atomic "
"no-replace operation in the same filesystem; LMCache does not reopen "
"transfer files or call ``fsync`` on NIXL-owned descriptors."
msgstr "每个批次中的文件都会接收一个独特的合成设备 ID。NIXL 打开一个注册的路径，通过传输拥有其文件描述符，并在注销期间关闭它。对于存储，``sync`` 请求 NIXL 保留持久完成边界。在注销关闭文件后，LMCache 通过在同一文件系统中执行原子无替换操作来发布已完成的临时路径；LMCache 不会重新打开传输文件或在 NIXL 拥有的描述符上调用 ``fsync``。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:120
msgid ""
"The store path does not perform an existence query; the caller is "
"expected to query first. If another worker thread wins the publication "
"race, an existing file of the expected size is accepted, while a "
"different size is an error. A failed batch removes its unpublished "
"temporary files and rolls back files published by that batch. Concurrent "
"workers are supported within one LMCache process, but a ``file_path`` "
"namespace must not be written by multiple LMCache processes."
msgstr "存储路径不执行存在性查询；调用者需要先进行查询。如果另一个工作线程赢得了发布竞争，则接受预期大小的现有文件，而不同大小则会导致错误。失败的批次会删除其未发布的临时文件，并回滚该批次发布的文件。支持在一个 LMCache 进程内的并发工作线程，但 ``file_path`` 命名空间不得被多个 LMCache 进程写入。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:128
msgid ""
"The submission path also performs no duplicate-key scan. Duplicate "
"serialized keys in one batch violate the caller contract and must be "
"removed upstream."
msgstr "提交路径也不执行重复键扫描。一个批次中的重复序列化键违反了调用者合同，必须在上游移除。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:131
msgid ""
"Files persist when the connector closes. Lookup calls NIXL ``queryMem`` "
"with the complete deterministic path, not a mode-prefixed string. Load "
"performs no filesystem open, existence check, or size preflight in "
"LMCache. The caller must query first and provide the correct destination "
"length; NIXL registers every ``ro:<absolute-path>`` descriptor and "
"executes the tile as one batch. A registration or transfer error fails "
"that load batch. Delete removes the deterministic file."
msgstr "文件在连接器关闭时保持持久。查找调用 NIXL ``queryMem``，使用完整的确定性路径，而不是带模式前缀的字符串。加载在 LMCache 中不执行文件系统打开、存在性检查或大小预检。调用者必须先查询并提供正确的目标长度；NIXL 注册每个 ``ro:<absolute-path>`` 描述符，并将瓦片作为一个批次执行。注册或传输错误会导致该加载批次失败。删除操作会移除确定性文件。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:139
msgid ""
"Set ``use_direct_io`` to ``\"true\"`` to request direct I/O for eligible "
"FILE buffers. The connector reads the target filesystem's direct-I/O "
"alignment from ``statvfs(file_path).f_bsize`` and decides eligibility per"
" buffer: a buffer uses direct I/O only when both its address and its byte"
" length are exact multiples of that alignment. An address- or length-"
"misaligned buffer automatically falls back to buffered I/O for that "
"descriptor instead of failing, so one batched request can mix both "
"descriptor forms:"
msgstr "将 ``use_direct_io`` 设置为 ``\"true\"`` 以请求适用于合格 FILE 缓冲区的直接 I/O。连接器从 ``statvfs(file_path).f_bsize`` 读取目标文件系统的直接 I/O 对齐，并根据每个缓冲区决定资格：只有当缓冲区的地址和字节长度都是该对齐的精确倍数时，缓冲区才会使用直接 I/O。地址或长度未对齐的缓冲区会自动回退到该描述符的缓冲 I/O，而不是失败，因此一个批处理请求可以混合这两种描述符形式："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:154
msgid ""
"The fallback exists because unaligned buffers previously failed; "
"selecting the I/O mode per descriptor keeps the direct-I/O benefit for "
"every eligible buffer instead of rejecting the whole batch. This "
"filesystem alignment is independent of the L1 allocator alignment (``--l1"
"-align-bytes``): L1 layout is enforced by the allocator and adapter and "
"is never validated by the connector as a FILE I/O constraint. As an "
"adapter-level optimization (not a connector requirement), direct-I/O "
"transfers still cover each object's full alignment-padded L1 slot — "
"logical bytes plus padding up to ``--l1-align-bytes`` — so padded buffers"
" stay eligible for direct I/O. On-disk files are therefore alignment-"
"sized multiples, and loading them requires the same ``--l1-align-bytes`` "
"and direct-I/O setting as the store. Buffered transfers (direct I/O off) "
"and OBJECT storage are never padded. The fallback covers only this "
"deterministic alignment preflight: NIXL registration, ``open()``, and "
"transfer failures still fail the batch, and the separate ``fs`` connector"
" keeps its own behavior. ``shard_dirs: \"true\"`` stores files under two "
"hash-prefix directories; choose that layout before populating a cache."
msgstr "回退机制的存在是因为未对齐的缓冲区之前失败；按描述符选择 I/O 模式可以保持每个合格缓冲区的直接 I/O 优势，而不是拒绝整个批处理。此文件系统对齐与 L1 分配器对齐（``--l1-align-bytes``）无关：L1 布局由分配器和适配器强制执行，连接器从不将其视为 FILE I/O 约束进行验证。作为适配器级优化（不是连接器要求），直接 I/O 传输仍然覆盖每个对象的完整对齐填充 L1 槽——逻辑字节加上填充，直到 ``--l1-align-bytes``——因此填充缓冲区仍然符合直接 I/O 的条件。因此，磁盘上的文件是对齐大小的倍数，加载它们需要与存储相同的 ``--l1-align-bytes`` 和直接 I/O 设置。缓冲传输（关闭直接 I/O）和对象存储从不填充。回退仅涵盖此确定性对齐的预检：NIXL 注册、``open()`` 和传输失败仍会导致批处理失败，单独的 ``fs`` 连接器保持其自身行为。``shard_dirs: \\\"true\\\"`` 将文件存储在两个哈希前缀目录下；在填充缓存之前选择该布局。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:173
msgid "OBJ OBJECT example"
msgstr "OBJ OBJECT 示例"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:175
msgid ""
"Inject credentials through the AWS environment or another credential "
"provider supported by the AWS SDK. Do not put credentials in "
"``backend_params`` because configuration can be displayed by operational "
"tooling."
msgstr "通过 AWS 环境或 AWS SDK 支持的其他凭证提供者注入凭证。请勿将凭证放入 ``backend_params`` 中，因为配置可能会被操作工具显示。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:200
msgid ""
"The tested NIXL 1.3 OBJ parameters are ``bucket``, ``endpoint_override``,"
" ``scheme``, ``region``, ``use_virtual_addressing``, ``req_checksum``, "
"and ``resp_checksum``. Consult the selected plugin's documentation before"
" adding other parameters."
msgstr "测试过的 NIXL 1.3 OBJ 参数包括 ``bucket``、``endpoint_override``、``scheme``、``region``、``use_virtual_addressing``、``req_checksum`` 和 ``resp_checksum``。在添加其他参数之前，请查阅所选插件的文档。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:205
msgid ""
"OBJECT stores are unconditional whole-object writes. Store completion "
"means the NIXL request reached its terminal success state; the connector "
"does not perform an existence preflight. Query uses the plugin's object "
"query API. NIXL 1.3 returns existence but not object length, so the "
"connector cannot reject an oversized object before issuing a ranged read."
" Partial writes are impossible through this adapter because every "
"descriptor starts at object offset zero and covers the complete LMCache "
"object."
msgstr "OBJECT 存储是无条件的整体对象写入。存储完成意味着 NIXL 请求达到了其最终成功状态；连接器不执行存在性预检。查询使用插件的对象查询 API。NIXL 1.3 返回存在性但不返回对象长度，因此连接器无法在发出范围读取之前拒绝超大对象。通过此适配器进行部分写入是不可能的，因为每个描述符从对象偏移量零开始，并覆盖完整的 LMCache 对象。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:215
msgid ""
"NIXL 1.3 has no supported object-deletion API. ``nixl_native`` therefore "
"reports ``supports_delete: false`` and rejects eviction configuration for"
" ``OBJECT``. Objects remain until external bucket lifecycle or "
"administrative tooling removes them."
msgstr "NIXL 1.3 不支持对象删除 API。因此 ``nixl_native`` 报告 ``supports_delete: false`` 并拒绝对 ``OBJECT`` 的逐出配置。对象将保留，直到外部桶生命周期或管理工具将其移除。"

