msgid ""
"For example, model ``org/model``, rank 42, object group 7, hash "
"``00112233``, and salt ``tenant`` becomes:"
msgstr "例如，模型 ``org/model``、排名 42、对象组 7、哈希 ``00112233`` 和盐 ``tenant`` 变为："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:237
msgid ""
"This is the same persistent filename format used by ``fs_native``. With "
"``shard_dirs: \"true\"``, the example lives below ``00/11/``. For object "
"storage those separators form an object-key prefix; for file storage they"
" are directories beneath ``file_path``."
msgstr "这与 ``fs_native`` 使用的持久文件名格式相同。使用 ``shard_dirs: \\\"true\\\"`` 时，示例位于 ``00/11/`` 目录下。对于对象存储，这些分隔符形成对象键前缀；对于文件存储，它们是 ``file_path`` 目录下的子目录。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:243
msgid "Benchmarking"
msgstr "基准测试"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:245
msgid ""
"Use the public L2 benchmark so all adapters receive equivalent arena-"
"backed buffers. The following command verifies a POSIX round trip:"
msgstr "使用公共 L2 基准测试，以便所有适配器接收等效的基于区域的缓冲区。以下命令验证 POSIX 往返："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:256
msgid ""
"Run the same command with ``fs_native`` on the same filesystem, payload "
"size, worker count, and cache state. The existing Python ``nixl_store`` "
"and ``nixl_store_dynamic`` adapters should also be compared after "
"confirming that their prepared-descriptor index contract is compatible "
"with the benchmark's arena offsets. On the current development tree with "
"NIXL 1.3.1, both Python adapters reject this harness with ``makeXferReq "
"local index out of range``; do not report their failed runs as "
"performance results."
msgstr "在相同的文件系统、负载大小、工作线程数量和缓存状态下，使用 ``fs_native`` 运行相同的命令。在确认其准备好的描述符索引契约与基准的区域偏移兼容后，还应比较现有的 Python ``nixl_store`` 和 ``nixl_store_dynamic`` 适配器。在当前的开发树上，使用 NIXL 1.3.1，两个 Python 适配器都因 ``makeXferReq local index out of range`` 拒绝此测试；请勿将它们的失败运行报告为性能结果。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:264
msgid ""
"Record the NIXL version, filesystem/device, direct-I/O setting, CPU "
"allocation, and whether the page cache was warm. OBJ results must also "
"record the object-store implementation, network topology, request size, "
"and non-secret endpoint settings."
msgstr "记录 NIXL 版本、文件系统/设备、直接 I/O 设置、CPU 分配，以及页面缓存是否处于热状态。OBJ 结果还必须记录对象存储实现、网络拓扑、请求大小和非机密端点设置。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:270
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:272
msgid "``lmcache_nixl`` cannot be imported"
msgstr "``lmcache_nixl`` 无法导入"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:273
msgid ""
"Rebuild with ``BUILD_WITH_NIXL=1`` and verify that ``NIXL_INCLUDE_DIR`` "
"contains ``nixl.h`` and ``NIXL_LIBRARY_DIR`` contains ``libnixl.so``."
msgstr "使用 ``BUILD_WITH_NIXL=1`` 重新构建，并验证 ``NIXL_INCLUDE_DIR`` 是否包含 ``nixl.h``，以及 ``NIXL_LIBRARY_DIR`` 是否包含 ``libnixl.so``。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:276
msgid "Plugin discovery or backend creation fails"
msgstr "插件发现或后端创建失败"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:277
msgid ""
"Verify NIXL 1.3 or newer, set ``NIXL_PLUGIN_DIR`` to the installed plugin"
" directory, and confirm that the requested plugin supports ``DRAM_SEG`` "
"and exactly one of ``FILE_SEG`` or ``OBJ_SEG``."
msgstr "验证 NIXL 1.3 或更高版本，将 ``NIXL_PLUGIN_DIR`` 设置为已安装插件目录，并确认请求的插件支持 ``DRAM_SEG`` 并且仅支持 ``FILE_SEG`` 或 ``OBJ_SEG`` 之一。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:281
msgid "Buffer is outside the registered L1 arena"
msgstr "缓冲区位于注册的 L1 区域之外"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:282
msgid ""
"The factory must receive the same L1 arena that owns every submitted "
"``MemoryObj``. The connector deliberately does not register arbitrary "
"process memory."
msgstr "工厂必须接收拥有每个提交的 ``MemoryObj`` 的相同 L1 区域。连接器故意不注册任意进程内存。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:286
msgid "Direct I/O is not used for some buffers"
msgstr "某些缓冲区不使用直接 I/O。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:287
msgid ""
"Eligibility is per buffer: the buffer address and byte length must both "
"be exact multiples of the filesystem's direct-I/O alignment, read from "
"``statvfs(file_path).f_bsize``. Misaligned buffers fall back to buffered "
"I/O for that descriptor instead of failing, so this is a performance "
"observation, not an error. Keep ``--l1-align-bytes`` at or above the "
"filesystem block size so the adapter's padded L1 slots stay eligible."
msgstr "每个缓冲区的资格是独立的：缓冲区地址和字节长度必须都是文件系统直接 I/O 对齐的精确倍数，该值可以通过 ``statvfs(file_path).f_bsize`` 获取。未对齐的缓冲区会回退到该描述符的缓冲 I/O，而不是失败，因此这是一个性能观察，而不是错误。保持 ``--l1-align-bytes`` 在文件系统块大小或以上，以确保适配器的填充 L1 插槽保持合格。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:294
msgid "OBJ authentication or lookup fails"
msgstr "OBJ 认证或查找失败"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:295
msgid ""
"Check the credential provider, bucket, endpoint, scheme, region, and path"
" versus virtual addressing choice. Status output includes backend and "
"storage type but never includes ``backend_params`` or credential values."
msgstr "检查凭证提供者、存储桶、端点、方案、区域和路径与虚拟地址选择的匹配情况。状态输出包括后端和存储类型，但从不包括 ``backend_params`` 或凭证值。"

